<RelActCalcAuto version="0">
	<Description>Multi-enrichment Uranium: two relative efficiency curves to detect stacked U objects of differing enrichment, with the HIGHER-enriched object in FRONT (nearer the detector, acting as the blocker). U232 is placed on the front (Outer) curve. Requires HPGe data with high statistics, a background, and a detector efficiency.</Description>
